items-start justify-between gap-6\"><div><p class=\"font-sans text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#77736c]\">Central Vietnam</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-serif text-4xl tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-5xl\">Da Nang</h3></div><span class=\"pt-1 font-sans text-xs transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\">→</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-md font-sans text-sm leading-6 text-[#77736c]\">A coastal city where beaches, mountains, modern resorts, and intimate celebrations come together.</p></a><a class=\"group md:mt-32\" href=\"/destinations/vietnam/hoi-an\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-[#ddd8cf]\"><img alt=\"Hoi An destination wedding\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.03]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fhoi-an.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fhoi-an.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fhoi-an.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fhoi-an.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fhoi-an.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fhoi-an.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fhoi-an.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fhoi-an.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fhoi-an.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fhoi-an.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/10 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-black/0\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.15em] text-white\">02</div></div><