absolute left-6 top-6 font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.15em] text-white\">03</div></div><div class=\"mt-7 flex items-start justify-between gap-6\"><div><p class=\"font-sans text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#77736c]\">Southern Vietnam</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-serif text-4xl tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-5xl\">Phu Quoc</h3></div><span class=\"pt-1 font-sans text-xs transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\">→</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-md font-sans text-sm leading-6 text-[#77736c]\">A tropical island of quiet beaches, warm light, and intimate resort celebrations surrounded by the sea.</p></a><a class=\"group md:mt-32\" href=\"/destinations/vietnam/nha-trang\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-[#ddd8cf]\"><img alt=\"Nha Trang destination wedding\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.03]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fnha-trang.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fnha-trang.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fnha-trang.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fnha-trang.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fnha-trang.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fnha-trang.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fnha-trang.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fnha-trang.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fnha-trang.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fnha-trang.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/10 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-black/0\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.15em] text-white\">04</div></div><div class=\"mt-7 flex items-start justify-between gap-6\"><div><p class=\"font-sans text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#77736c]\">Central Vietnam</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-serif text-4xl tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-5xl\">Nha Trang</h3></div><span class=\"pt-1 font-sans text-xs transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\">→</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-md font-sans text-sm leading-6 text-[#77736c]\">A coastal destination known for its turquoise water, beachfront resorts, and relaxed celebrations by the sea.</p></a><a class=\"group \" href=\"/destinations/vietnam/con-dao\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-[#ddd8cf]\"><img alt=\"Con Dao destination wedding\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.03]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fcon-dao.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fcon-dao.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fcon-dao.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fcon-dao.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fcon-dao.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fcon-dao.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fcon-dao.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fcon-dao.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fcon-dao.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fcon-dao.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/10 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-black/0\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.15em] text-white\">05</div></div><div class=\"mt-7 flex items-start justify-between gap-6\"><div><p class=\"font-sans text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#77736c]\">Southern Vietnam</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-serif text-4xl tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-5xl\">Con Dao</h3></div><span class=\"pt-1 font-sans text-xs transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\">→</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-md font-sans text-sm leading-6 text-[#77736c]\">A remote island destination with untouched beaches, dramatic landscapes, and an atmosphere of quiet escape.</p></a><a class=\"group md:mt-32\" href=\"/destinations/vietnam/ba-na-hills\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden bg-[#ddd8cf]\"><img alt=\"Ba Na Hills destination wedding\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.03]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fba-na-hills.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fba-na-hills.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fba-na-hills.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fba-na-hills.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fba-na-hills.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fba-na-hills.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fba-na-hills.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fba-na-hills.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fba-na-hills.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fdestinations%2Fba-na-hills.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/10 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:bg-black/0\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-6 top-6 font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.15em] text-white\">06</div></div><div class=\"mt-7 flex items-start justify-between gap-6\"><div><p class=\"font-sans text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-[#77736c]\">Central Vietnam</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-serif text-4xl tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-5xl\">Ba Na Hills</h3></div><span class=\"pt-1 font-sans text-xs transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\">→</span></div><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-md font-sans text-sm leading-6 text-[#77736c]\">A mountain destination above Da Nang, known for dramatic landscapes, changing weather, and distinctive architecture.</p></a></div></div></section><section class=\"border-t border-[#d8d3ca] px-6 py-32 md:px-10 md:py-48\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-16 md:grid-cols-12\"><div class=\"md:col-span-4\"><p class=\"font-sans text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase\">Wedding Stories</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-4xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-6xl\">Destination weddings,<br/>made personal.</h2><p class=\"mt-10 font-sans text-sm leading-7 text-[#77736c]\">From intimate wedding celebrations and beach weddings to destination weddings surrounded by nature, we photograph and film celebrations that feel connected to the people and the place.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"border-t border-[#d8d3ca] px-6 py-32 md:px-10 md:py-48\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-5xl leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.03em] md:text-8xl\">Planning a wedding<br/>in <!-- -->Vietnam<!-- -->?</h2><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-md font-sans text-sm leading-7 text-[#77736c]\">Tell us about your destination wedding, beach wedding, or intimate celebration.</p><a class=\"mt-12 inline-block font-sans text-xs trac